259
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,260
Oh, Lieutenant Marito.

260
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,020
No, that one's still being tuned.

261
00:19:05,220 --> 00:19:06,340
But it runs okay, right?

262
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:08,260
I just needed to work for one shot.

263
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:10,120
Get a heavy barrel ready for it.

264
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:15,360
Damn it.

265
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:26,740
Oh, come on.

266
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,540
