267
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,980
Block 24 has been breached.

268
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:39,300
Blocks 23, 24, and 25 taking all water.

269
00:19:39,700 --> 00:19:41,620
Evacuate the affected blocks immediately.

270
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:44,180
But if we don't seal the bulkheads, we're sure to...

271
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:45,020
No, it's all right.

272
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:47,280
The ship is done for anyway.

273
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:49,180
Abandon ship.

274
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:50,560
Non-combatants first.

275
00:19:50,940 --> 00:19:52,620
Get the landing craft prepped for launch.

276
00:20:00,220 --> 00:20:01,340
