277
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:03,620
This way!

278
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:04,440
Hurry up!

279
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:06,960
Please be careful, Your Highness.

280
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,760
Yes, I will.

281
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:15,320
Enemy units are coming in from above!

282
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:16,320
